### List (page=1, newest)
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?page=1&sort=newest

### List (search)
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?search=ноутбук&page=1

### Get by id
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements/1

### Create (вставте accessToken)
POST http://localhost:3000/announcements
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Продам велосипед",
  "description": "Гірський велосипед, 21 швидкість",
  "price": 8000,
  "category": "sale"
}

### Update (вставте accessToken)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 6500,
  "title": "Продам велосипед терміново"
}

### Delete (вставте accessToken)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

